== osc.sine "Oscillator" finder="Oscillator" Source
in   V/Oct              Control  ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   FM                 Control  ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   Exp FM             Control  ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   PWM                Control  ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   Sync               Control  ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   Octave             Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0 [-4..4] oct stepped
in   Semitone           Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0 [-12..12] st stepped
in   Fine               Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0 [-100..100] ct
in   FM Depth           Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0 [0..5]
in   Exp FM Depth       Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 1 [0..4] oct
in   Waveform           Control  ConstantOnly         inline=true  select 0 ["Sine", "Saw", "Square", "Tri"] "Wave"
in   Pulse Width        Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.5 [0.1..0.9]
in   Voices             Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 1 [1..7]  stepped
in   Detune             Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.4 [0..1] %
in   Spread             Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.5 [0..1] %
out  Out                Audio
out  Sub                Audio
out  Out L              Audio
out  Out R              Audio
knob Octave             "Oct" KnobOnly
knob Semitone           "Semi" KnobOnly
knob Fine               "Fine" KnobOnly
knob FM Depth           "FM" KnobOnly
knob Exp FM Depth       "Exp FM" KnobOnly
knob Pulse Width        "PW" KnobOnly
knob Voices             "Voices" KnobOnly
knob Detune             "Detune" KnobOnly
knob Spread             "Spread" KnobOnly
display OscillatorWave

