in   Loop End           Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 1 [0..1] %
in   Tune               Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0 [-24..24] st stepped
in   Fine               Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0 [-100..100] ct
in   Root               Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 60 [0..127] note stepped
in   Attack             Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.002 [0.001..2] s log
in   Release            Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.01 [0.001..5] s log
in   Level              Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.8 [0..1]
out  L                  Audio
out  R                  Audio
